        rdfs:comment        "Inositol phosphates IP4 and IP5 are exported from the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) lumen to the nucleus (Caffrey et al. 1999, Chi et al. 1999, Nalaskowski et al. 2002, Verbsky et al. 2002, Brehm et al. 2007, Choi et al. 2007). The molecular details of these transport processes remain uncertain." ;
